Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): refuse unsupported Sodick angle-word moves

Retain the taper refusal and record the missing controller mapping.
Pin per-move angle refusal even without section taper metadata.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1496
